---
export const title = 'Search and order';
export const order = 200;
import DemoComponentCard from '../../../../components/DemoComponentCard.astro';
---

<p>
  <code>searchable</code> adds a search box above each list that filters its items by label and
  description. The move buttons then act on the matching items only.
</p>
<p>
  Without <code>ordered</code> the value keeps the order of <code>options</code>. With
  <code>ordered</code> the selected list keeps the person's order: moved items join at the end,
  Move up and Move down move the checked items, and <kbd>Alt</kbd>+<kbd>Up</kbd> and
  <kbd>Alt</kbd>+<kbd>Down</kbd> move the focused one. Use it when the order matters, such as the
  columns of a report.
</p>
<p>
  Each selected item also gets a drag handle. Drag it to where the drop line shows; when the item
  is checked, all checked items move together, keeping their order. <kbd>Escape</kbd> or a release
  outside the list cancels the drag. A drop is announced like a reorder ("Status, position 1 of
  4") and fires one <code>change</code>.
</p>

<DemoComponentCard lang={'html'}>
  <wc-transfer-list
    label='Report columns'
    searchable
    ordered
    available-headline='Columns'
    selected-headline='Shown'
    value='name,status,owner,updated'
    style='width: 100%; max-width: 44rem;'
    options='[{"value":"name","label":"Name"},{"value":"email","label":"Email"},{"value":"status","label":"Status"},{"value":"created","label":"Created","description":"Date the record was added"},{"value":"updated","label":"Updated"},{"value":"owner","label":"Owner"},{"value":"region","label":"Region"}]'
  ></wc-transfer-list>
</DemoComponentCard>

<h3>Narrow containers</h3>
<p>
  The component reacts to its own width, not the viewport's: below 36rem the lists stack,
  "Available" above "Selected", and the arrows turn to point down and up.
</p>

<DemoComponentCard lang={'html'}>
  <wc-transfer-list
    label='Members'
    style='width: 100%; max-width: 22rem;'
    options='[{"value":"ana","label":"Ana"},{"value":"ben","label":"Ben"},{"value":"chen","label":"Chen"}]'
  ></wc-transfer-list>
</DemoComponentCard>
